flowchart TD

    A[Infrastructure Change] --> B[OpenTofu Configuration]

    B --> C[OpenTofu Validate]

    C --> D[Saved OpenTofu Plan]

    D --> E[Plan JSON]

    E --> F[OPA Infrastructure Policy]

    F --> G{Security Decision}

    G -->|DENY| H[Reject Change]
    G -->|ALLOW| I[Eligible for Deployment Workflow]

    F --> J[IAC-001 to IAC-011]

    D --> K[Plan SHA-256]
    F --> L[Policy SHA-256]
    M[Provider Lockfile] --> N[Lockfile SHA-256]

    K --> O[Policy Evidence]
    L --> O
    N --> O
    G --> O

    O --> P[GitHub Actions Evidence Artifact]
